*.lock
!requirements.lock
__pycache__/
*.kicad_prl
boards/*/state_snapshots/
# 3D models pulled from LCSC/EasyEDA (manufacturers' material, NOTICE);
# re-pull with `hwde lib_pull --parts parts/parts.json --project kicad`.
boards/*/lib/*.3dshapes/
# Part datasheets (manufacturers' material, NOTICE); index.json keeps each
# one's URL and sha256. Re-fetch with `hwde datasheet_extract --fetch <board>`.
boards/*/parts/datasheets/*.pdf
